! [unconnected] Total pump efficiency                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
! [unconnected] Motor efficiency                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
       35,3                                     35,4                                     PUMP32_CTRL                              CONST                                    CONST                                   
