       2.0000000000000000E+01    0.0000000000000000E+00    0.0000000000000000E+00    6.0000000000000009E-01    9.0000000000000002E-01
*------------------------------------------------------------------------------                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
* Model "受控分流器" (Type 11)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
